  "english": "23. Monday, Tone 2 [AK]. Of Fasting: of Mamas, etc.\nHarts [hymn], Tone 1 [AD]: \"Thee, righteous\" (Ըզքեզ արդար).\n25. Wednesday, Tone 4 [BK]. Of Fasting: Harts of Repentance [BK] 63.\n\"Blessed art thou, Lord, and glorified...\" (Օրհնեալ ես տէր եւ փառա).\n29. Sunday, Tone 8 [DK]. Third [Sunday]. Feast of the Holy Cross of Varag.\nThe interval of eating [non-fasting days] is seven\nweeks.\nOctober.\n6. Sunday, Tone 7 [DDz]. Fourth [Sunday]. Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 7 [DDz]: \"The Awesome\" (Ահագին).\n13. Sunday, Tone 6 [GK]. Fifth [Sunday]. Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 6 [GK]:\n\"The Divine\" (Զաստուածային) and \"Thy Resurrection\" (Ըզքո յար).\n20. Sunday, Tone 5 [GDz]. Sixth [Sunday]. Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 5 [GDz]: \"The Ointment-bearing\" (Իւղաբեր), and \"Today the Resurrection\" (Այսօր յարութիւն), and\n\"By the sign of the Cross\" (Ի խաչանիշ).\n23. Wednesday, Tone 8 [DK]. Harts [hymn], Tone 6 [GK]: \"Holy God...\" (Սուրբ աստուած).\n[Garbled text]\nFather.\n27. Sunday, Tone 4 [BK]. Seventh [Sunday]. Discovery of the Cross.\n29. Tuesday, Tone 6 [GK]. Of the Hyperichians, and of Seve-\n-rian, etc. Harts [hymn], Tone 8 [DK]: \"Who\nthe wondrous\" (զհրաշափառ).\nNovember.\n2. Saturday, Tone 2 [AK]. Of All Saints, old and\nnew, etc.\n3. Sunday, Tone 3 [BDz]. Eighth [Sunday]. Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 3 [BDz]: \"In\nthe tomb\" (Ի գերեզման), and \"They came to the tomb\" (Եկին ի գերեզման),\nand \"The voice of good tidings\" (Ձայն աւետաւոր).\n10. Sunday, Tone 2 [AK]. Ninth [Sunday]. Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 2 [AK]: \"The risen\nLord\" (Յարուցեալ տէրն), to the end.\n17. Sunday, Tone 1 [ADz]. Tenth [Sunday]. Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 1 [AD]:\n\"Who ineffable\" (Որ անճառ), to the end. Eve (Barekendan)\nof the Fast of Advent (Yisnakats).\n18. Monday, Tone 2 [AK]. Fast of Advent. Harts [hymn]\nof Repentance, Tone 7 [DDz]: \"Blessed art thou forever\" (Օրհնեալ ես յաւիտեան).\n21. Thursday, Tone 5 [GDz]. Of Fasting. Feast of the Presentation\nof the Holy Mother of God.\n24. Sunday, Tone 8 [DK]. First [Sunday of Advent]. Harts [hymn], Tone 2 [AK]: \"Without\nbeginning, Word\" (Անսկիզբն բանդ). Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 8 [DK]: \"Of the angels\"\nhosts (Հրեշտակացն դասք), and \"Thy Angel,\nO Lord\" (Հրեշտակ քո տէր).\n25. Monday, Tone 1 [ADz]. Of Julian and Vasi-\n-louhi, and of Abraham and Kho-\n-ren, of Cosmas and Damian,\nand of Astuadsatur the witness.\nHarts [hymn], Tone 4 [BK]: \"We bless thee, Lord\" (Օրհնեմք զքեզ տէր).\nAnd for the others, see the First Volume,\nkeeping the order of this place.\nDecember.\n1. Sunday, Tone 7 [DDz]. Second [Sunday]. Harts [hymn], Tone 3 [BDz]: \"Incor-\n-ruptible\" (Անապական). Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 5 [GDz]: \"Who art above\" (Որ ի վերդ ես).\n2. Monday, Tone 8 [DK]. Of Gennarius and Mer-\n-curius, and of James and I-\n-phrotar.\n3. Tuesday, Tone 1 [ADz]. Of Minas, Hermogenes,\netc. Harts [hymn], Tone 4 [BK]: \"Who in battle\" (Որք ի մարտի).\n8. Sunday, Tone 6 [GK]. Third [Sunday]. Harts [hymn], Tone 4 [BK]: \"God without\nbeginning\" (Անսկիզբն աստուած). Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 6 [GK]:\n\"Taken [from us] and our\" (Առեալ եւ մեր). Eve (Barekendan)\nof the Fast of Saint James.\n9. Monday, Tone 7 [DDz]. Fast. Feast of the Conception\nof the Holy Virgin from Anna.\n15. Sunday, Tone 5 [GDz]. Fourth [Sunday]. Harts [hymn], Tone 5 [GDz]: \"Glo-\n-rified Son\" (Փառաւորեալ որդի). Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 5 [GDz]: \"Glo-\n-rified is Thy\" (Փառաւորեալ է քո), to the end.\n18. Wednesday, Tone 8 [DK]. Harts of Repentance, Tone 8 [DK]: \"Blessed\nLord God of our fathers\" (տէր աստուած հարցն մերոց).\n22. Sunday, Tone 4 [BK]. Fifth [Sunday]. Harts [hymn], Tone 6 [GK]:\n\"Before eternity\" (Նախայաւիտեան). Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 4 [BK]: \"Chri-\n-st rose\" (Քրիստոս յարեաւ), to the end.\n23. Monday, Tone 5 [GDz]. Of David the Prophet and\nof James the Apostle.\n29. Sunday, Tone 3 [BDz]. Sixth [Sunday]. Harts [hymn], Tone 7 [DDz]:\n\"Only-begotten Son\" (Միածին որդի). Hambartsi [hymn], Tone 3 [BDz]: \"Today\nrejoice\" (Այսօր զուարճացեալ), to the end. Eve (Barekendan)\nof the Fast of the Nativity.\n30. Monday, Tone 4 [BK]. Of Fasting. Harts [hymn], Tone 8 [DK]: \"Bles-\n-sed art thou, Lord God, blessed\" (Օրհնեալ տէր աստուած օրհնեալ).\nAnd the rest in order.\nJanuary.\n5. Sunday, Tone 2 [AK]. Seventh [Sunday]. Eve (Vigil)\nof the Nativity of Christ.",
